pt from this skill.\n4. Inspect the returned JSON. Treat `success: true` and non-empty `images` as the completion signal.\n5. If the script fails, read `codex_output` and `error` in the JSON or terminal output before retrying with a clearer prompt.\n\n## Script\n\nMain script:\n\n```bash\nnode ~/.codex/skills/codex-image-gen/scripts/generate-image-with-codex.mjs --help\n```\n\nUseful options:\n\n- `--prompt <text>`: image prompt text.\n- `--prompt-file <path>`: read prompt from a file.\n- `--out-dir <dir>`: required output directory.\n- `--count <n>`: requested image count, default `1`.\n- `--prefix <name>`: preferred filename prefix, default `codex-image`.\n- `--model <model>`: pass a model to the child Codex command when using the default command.\n- `--codex-command <command>`: override the child command. Use this when the local CLI exposes a `codex -p \"prompt\"` style interface.\n- `--timeout-ms <n>`: child process timeout, default 10 minutes.\n- `--dry-run`: print the generated child prompt and command without running Codex.\n\nDefault child command:\n\n```bash\ncodex exec --skip-git-repo-check --sandbox danger-full-access -C <out-dir> <wrapped prompt>\n```\n\nIf the local Codex CLI uses `codex -p` for non-interactive prompting, run:\n\n```bash\nnode ~/.codex/skills/codex-image-gen/scripts/generate-image-with-codex.mjs \\\n  --prompt \"...\" \\\n  --out-dir ./imgs \\\n  --codex-command \"codex -p\"\n```\n\n## Prompt Guidance\n\nWrite prompts that include:\n\n- subject and scene\n- visual style\n- aspect ratio or orientation\n- text language and exact text, if text is required\n- output count\n- any brand or safety constraints\n\nExample:\n\n```text\n生成 1 张 16:9 横版中文技术知识卡。主题：/goal 如何让 Agent 持续工作到有证据。\n风格：奶油纸底 sketchnote，深海军蓝手绘线，低饱和便签色块。\n图片中文字保持简短中文标签，不要真实品牌 Logo。\n```\n\n## Failure Rules\n\nDo not silently create placeholder images when native Codex image generation is unavailable. The child Codex prompt tells the child run to fail and explain the blocker instead.\n\nIf no image file appears in the output directory after the child run, treat the generation as failed even if Codex returned exit code `0`.\n\n2026-07-25T03:27:20.557266Z  WARN codex_protocol::openai_models: Model personality requested but model_messages is missing, falling back to base instructions. model=gpt-5.6-sol personality=pragmatic\n2026-07-25T03:27:20.623491Z  WARN codex_core_skills::loader: ignoring interface.icon_small: icon path must not contain '..'\n2026-07-25T03:27:20.623506Z  WARN codex_core_skills::loader: ignoring interface.icon_large: icon path must not contain '..'\n2026-07-25T03:27:20.632983Z  WARN codex_core_plugins::manifest: ignoring interface.defaultPrompt: maximum of 3 prompts is supported path=/Users/yjcjour/.codex/plugins/cache/openai-primary-runtime/template-creator/26.723.12215/.codex-plugin/plugin.json\n2026-07-25T03:27:20.633656Z  WARN codex_core_plugins::manifest: ignoring interface.defaultPrompt: maximum of 3 prompts is supported path=/Users/yjcjour/.codex/plugins/cache/openai-primary-runtime/template-creator/26.723.12215/.codex-plugin/plugin.json\n2026-07-25T03:27:20.638111Z  WARN codex_core_plugins::manifest: ignoring interface.defaultPrompt: maximum of 3 prompts is supported path=/Users/yjcjour/.cache/codex-runtimes/codex-primary-runtime/plugins/openai-primary-runtime/plugins/template-creator/.codex-plugin/plugin.json\n2026-07-25T03:27:20.643147Z  WARN codex_core_plugins::manifest: ignoring interface.defaultPrompt[0]: prompt must be at most 128 characters path=/Users/yjcjour/.codex/.tmp/plugins/plugins/ngs-analysis/.codex-plugin/plugin.json\n2026-07-25T03:27:20.681891Z  WARN codex_core_skills::loader: ignoring interface.icon_small: icon path must not contain '..'\n2026-07-25T03:27:20.681908Z  WARN codex_core_skills::loader: ignoring interface.icon_large: icon path must not contain '..'\n2026-07-25T03:27:20.682548Z  WARN codex_core_skills::loader: ignoring interface.icon_small: icon path must not contain '..'\n2026-07-25T03